art":82.194},{"w":"the","start":82.514},{"w":"chat","start":82.674},{"w":"so","start":83.074},{"w":"far.","start":83.394},{"w":"Every","start":83.914},{"w":"earlier","start":84.354},{"w":"message","start":84.834},{"w":"in","start":85.274},{"w":"the","start":85.394},{"w":"conversation","start":85.514},{"w":"is","start":86.154},{"w":"sent","start":86.354},{"w":"again,","start":86.634},{"w":"so","start":86.994},{"w":"the","start":87.234},{"w":"model","start":87.394},{"w":"can","start":87.874},{"w":"see","start":88.114},{"w":"it.","start":88.314}]},{"id":"c16","start":88.932,"end":93.419,"marks":{},"text":"All of that travels together to a server in a data centre, where the model lives.","words":[{"w":"All","start":88.932},{"w":"of","start":89.132},{"w":"that","start":89.252},{"w":"travels","start":89.492},{"w":"together","start":89.972},{"w":"to","start":90.372},{"w":"a","start":90.492},{"w":"server","start":90.612},{"w":"in","start":90.972},{"w":"a","start":91.092},{"w":"data","start":91.212},{"w":"centre,","start":91.652},{"w":"where","start":92.092},{"w":"the","start":92.292},{"w":"model","start":92.412},{"w":"lives.","start":92.892}]}],"title":"What the app really sends","shortTitle":"What the app really sends","props":{"kicker":"Stage 1 · Send","title":"The app sends more than you typed","steps":[{"label":"Your prompt","detail":"“Write a short poem…”"},{"label":"Instructions","detail":"hidden rules from the app"},{"label":"Chat so far","detail":"every earlier message"},{"label":"To the server","detail":"where the model runs"}]},"start":66.6,"end":93.419,"startFrame":1998,"durationInFrames":832},{"id":"tokens","kind":"core","component":"TokenBlocks","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c17","start":94.333,"end":102.634,"marks":{"prompt":99.693},"text":"Stage two. The model can't read letters, so the text is cut into tokens. Here's our prompt, with each coloured block showing one token.","words":[{"w":"Stage","start":94.333},{"w":"two.","start":94.853},{"w":"The","start":95.253},{"w":"model","start":95.453},{"w":"can't","start":95.853},{"w":"read","start":96.173},{"w":"letters,","start":96.493},{"w":"so","start":96.933},{"w":"the","start":97.053},{"w":"text","start":97.213},{"w":"is","start":97.573},{"w":"cut","start":97.733},{"w":"into","start":97.973},{"w":"tokens.","start":98.253},{"w":"Here's","start":99.093},{"w":"our","start":99.393},{"w":"prompt,","start":99.693},{"w":"with","start":100.173},{"w":"each","start":100.373},{"w":"coloured","start":100.653},{"w":"block","start":101.093},{"w":"showing","start":101.453},{"w":"one","start":101.853},{"w":"token.","start":102.093}]},{"id":"c18","start":103.034,"end":117.744,"marks":{},"text":"Common words are usually a single token each, and the space tends to travel along at the front. Rarer words get split into smaller pieces. Each token is then swapped for an ID number. That's our next-but-one stop, Token City.","words":[{"w":"Common","start":103.034},{"w":"words","start":103.474},{"w":"are","start":103.834},{"w":"usually","start":103.994},{"w":"a","start":104.474},{"w":"single","start":104.634},{"w":"token","start":105.034},{"w":"each,","start":105.514},{"w":"and","start":105.874},{"w":"the","start":106.074},{"w":"space","start":106.274},{"w":"tends","start":106.674},{"w":"to","start":106.994},{"w":"travel","start":107.194},{"w":"along","start":107.554},{"w":"at","start":107.954},{"w":"the","start":108.114},{"w":"front.","start":108.234},{"w":"Rarer","start":108.874},{"w":"words","start":109.394},{"w":"get","start":109.754},{"w":"split","start":109.994},{"w":"into","start":110.354},{"w":"smaller","start":110.594},{"w":"pieces.","start":111.034},{"w":"Each","start":111.834},{"w":"token","start":112.194},{"w":"is","start":112.714},{"w":"then","start":112.914},{"w":"swapped","start":113.194},{"w":"for","start":113.634},{"w":"an","start":113.794},{"w":"ID","start":114.194},{"w":"number.","start":114.594},{"w":"That's","start":114.994},{"w":"our","start":115.461},{"w":"next-but-one","start":115.927},{"w":"stop,","start":116.394},{"w":"Token","start":116.874},{"w":"City.","start":117.354}]}],"title":"Cut into tokens","shortTitle":"Cut into tokens","props":{"examples":[{"text":"Write a short poem about the rain","tokens":["Write"," a"," short"," poem"," about"," the"," rain"]}],"promptAt":"c17@prompt","rememberLast":false},"start":94.333,"end":117.744,"startFrame":2830,"durationInFrames":730},{"id":"embed","kind":"core","component":"Definition","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c19","start":118.667,"end":127.748,"marks":{},"text":"Stage three. An ID number on its own means nothing. So each token is turned into an embedding: a long list of numbers that captures what it means.","words":[{"w":"Stage","start":118.667},{"w":"three.","start":119.227},{"w":"An","start":119.627},{"w":"ID","start":119.96},{"w":"number","start":120.294},{"w":"on","start":120.627},{"w":"its","start":120.787},{"w":"own","start":120.987},{"w":"means","start":121.267},{"w":"nothing.","start":121.627},{"w":"So","start":122.187},{"w":"each","start":122.507},{"w":"token","start":122.867},{"w":"is","start":123.347},{"w":"turned","start":123.547},{"w":"into","start":123.867},{"w":"an","start":124.067},{"w":"embedding:","start":124.227},{"w":"a","start":124.867},{"w":"long","start":125.067},{"w":"list","start":125.387},{"w":"of","start":125.667},{"w":"numbers","start":125.947},{"w":"that","start":126.227},{"w":"captures","start":126.427},{"w":"what","start":126.987},{"w":"it","start":127.147},{"w":"means.","start":127.307}]},{"id":"c20","start":128.148,"end":132.857,"marks":{},"text":"The token \"rain\" becomes a list of hundreds, or even thousands, of numbers.","words":[{"w":"The","start":128.148},{"w":"token","start":128.308},{"w":"\"rain\"","start":128.828},{"w":"becomes","start":129.228},{"w":"a","start":129.628},{"w":"list","start":129.748},{"w":"of","start":129.988},{"w":"hundreds,","start":130.148},{"w":"or","start":130.788},{"w":"even","start":131.068},{"w":"thousands,","start":131.428},{"w":"of","start":131.904},{"w":"numbers.","start":132.381}]},{"id":"c21","start":133.257,"end":140.44,"marks":{},"text":"Think of it as an address on a map of meaning. \"Rain\" lives close to \"storm\" and \"cloud\", and far away from \"banana\".","words":[{"w":"Think","start":133.257},{"w":"of","start":133.417},{"w":"it","start":133.577},{"w":"as","start":133.697},{"w":"an","start":133.857},{"w":"address","start":133.977},{"w":"on","start":134.377},{"w":"a","start":134.497},{"w":"map","start":134.617},{"w":"of","start":134.857},{"w":"meaning.","start":135.057},{"w":"\"Rain\"","start":135.817},{"w":"lives","start":136.297},{"w":"close","start":136.817},{"w":"to","start":137.177},{"w":"\"storm\"","start":137.377},{"w":"and","start":137.857},{"w":"\"cloud\",","start":138.177},{"w":"and","start":138.697},{"w":"far","start":138.977},{"w":"away","start":139.297},{"w":"from","start":139.577},{"w":"\"banana\".","start":139.817}]}],"title":"Tokens become numbers","shortTitle":"Tokens become numbers","props":{"kicker":"Stage 3 · Embed","term":"Embedding","definition":"Each token becomes a long list of numbers that captures what it means.","example":"rain → [0.21, −0.73, 0.05, …]","analogy":"An address on a map of meaning: rain lives near storm and cloud."},"start":118.667,"end":140.44,"startFrame":3560,"durationInFrames":681},{"id":"attend","kind":"core","component":"Bullets","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c22","start":141.367,"end":146.957,"marks":{},"text":"Stage four is the heart of the model, called a transformer. Here, the tokens look at each other.","words":[{"w":"Stage","start":141.367},{"w":"four","start":141.767},{"w":"is","start":142.087},{"w":"the","start":142.247},{"w":"heart","start":142.407},{"w":"of","start":142.647},{"w":"the","start":142.727},{"w":"model,","start":142.847},{"w":"called","start":143.287},{"w":"a","start":143.647},{"w":"transformer.","start":143.807},{"w":"Here,","start":144.807},{"w":"the","start":145.287},{"w":"tokens","start":145.527},{"w":"look","start":146.127},{"w":"at","start":146.287},{"w":"each","start":146.487},{"w":"other.","start":146.647}]},{"id":"c23","start":147.357,"end":152.334,"marks":{},"text":"Every token looks at every other token in the prompt, and decides which ones matter to it.","words":[{"w":"Every","start":147.357},{"w":"token","start":147.677},{"w":"looks","start":148.157},{"w":"at","start":148.517},{"w":"every","start":148.757},{"w":"other","start":148.997},{"w":"token","start":149.237},{"w":"in","start":149.717},{"w":"the","start":149.797},{"w":"prompt,","start":149.917},{"w":"and","start":150.437},{"w":"decides","start":150.637},{"w":"which","start":151.197},{"w":"ones","start":151.437},{"w":"matter","start":151.717},{"w":"to","start":151.997},{"w":"it.","start":152.157}]},{"id":"c24","start":152.734,"end":160.187,"marks":{},"text":"For example, \"poem\" and \"short\" tell the model what \"rain\" is for: it's the subject of a short poem, not a weather report.","words":[{"w":"For","start":152.734},{"w":"example,","start":152.934},{"w":"\"poem\"","start":153.614},{"w":"and","start":154.094},{"w":"\"short\"","start":154.334},{"w":"tell","start":154.814},{"w":"the","start":154.974},{"w":"model","start":155.134},{"w":"what","start":155.534},{"w":"\"rain\"","start":155.774},{"w":"is","start":156.174},{"w":"for:","start":156.414},{"w":"it's","start":156.734},{"w":"the","start":157.174},{"w":"subject","start":157.374},{"w":"of","start":157.894},{"w":"a","start":158.014},{"w":"short","start":158.174},{"w":"poem,","start":158.494},{"w":"not","start":158.934},{"w":"a","start":159.134},{"w":"weather","start":159.254},{"w":"report.","start":159.614}]},{"id":"c25","start":160.587,"end":167.046,"marks":{},"text":"This happens again and again, in many layers, and with each layer the model's picture of your request gets sharper.","words":[{"w":"This","start":160.587},{"w":"happens","start":160.747},{"w":"again","start":161.267},{"w":"and","start":161.587},{"w":"again,","start":161.827},{"